","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6I=6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50e00722-93c5-4c6f-a20d-7ad043f735e8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"```autocmd BufNewFile *.java keeppatterns %s/ファイル名/\\=expand('%:t:r')/```\nプラグインを使わない場合はこうですね","ts":"1622454590.012300","edited":{"user":"U03C71D7H","ts":"1622454645.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fAK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8548DEF7-408C-4ADA-B2E4-E70B8457C8DD","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"そういうプラグインは結構あるのでたとえばこういうのはどうでしょうか","ts":"1622453974.011000","edited":{"user":"UBQ2H65JQ","ts":"1622453998.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0yYd9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8c6dc17-a5e1-4c13-9b68-c4422558accc","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-sonictemplate/blob/master/template/java/base-main.java\u003e\nこれかな","ts":"1622453965.010500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lHsUY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1EBB1961-5015-4AB1-AA1D-5694018CEFFE","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-sonictemplate|https://github.com/mattn/vim-sonictemplate\u003e","ts":"1622453946.009600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: mattn/vim-sonictemplate","id":1,"title":"mattn/vim-sonictemplate","title_link":"https://github.com/mattn/vim-sonictemplate","text":"Easy and high speed coding method. Contribute to mattn/vim-sonictemplate development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://repository-images.githubusercontent.com/2640484/febf5880-41f4-11ea-9b2c-e79b89e80f51","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/mattn/vim-sonictemplate","original_url":"https://github.com/mattn/vim-sonictemplate"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3oQE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b5d5940-4106-4ae4-8979-5ad999cee296","type":"message","user":"U023ASV0YTY","text":"初めましてプログラム(java)、Vim共に初心者です\n自分は新規javaファイルを作成時テンプレートを読み込ませてるのですが、その際にファイル名を自動で書き込ませたいのですが何か方法はないでしょうか？\n```テンプレート\npublic class ファイル名{\n\tpublic static void main(String[] args){\n\t\t\n\t}\n}```\n```.vimrc\n\nautocmd BufNewFile *.java  0r ~/Template.java\nautocmd BufNewFile *.java let @* = expand('%:r')\n\nnnoremap \u0026lt;C-t\u0026gt; :1s/ファイル名/```\n現状はファイル名をクリップボードにコピー、手動でコマンド入力、右クリックで貼り付け、って感じです","ts":"1622453892.009100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G4i4"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U023B24GZU6","text":"\u003c@U023B24GZU6\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622451327.002600","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U023ASV0YTY","text":"\u003c@U023ASV0YTY\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622448351.002300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U023PNE89KN","text":"\u003c@U023PNE89KN\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622446629.002000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"80a8947f-23eb-4b18-b6d0-74c979f12794","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"今回のやつもおそらく「場合によっては C-d を乗っ取って、場合によってはそのまま C-d が働く」になって欲しいのでしょうが、上に書かれてますが任意のキーになるから無理そうですね","ts":"1622444208.001800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b+WMr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5332a4a0-45d3-4f3d-8600-3e4a3cfcab53","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"fallback したいキーマッピングの場合は割とそうなっちゃいますよね。なんかいい方法あるといいんだけど","ts":"1622444088.001700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original