ype":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"nmapのC-dをC-dに振ってるからですね","ts":"1622443490.498000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xPAe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"392869cc-f65b-462c-b6a5-b6ddf5674d70","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"```nnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt;  \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-page-original-down) \u0026lt;C-d\u0026gt;\n\" silentじゃなくてもいいかもだけど\nnmap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-page-down-or-scroll-down-preview) fern#preview#smart_preview(\"\\\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-action-preview:half-down)\", \"\\\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-page-original-down)\")\nnmap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-d\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-page-down-or-scroll-down-preview)```\n","ts":"1622443488.497900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Xv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0E100ECC-B938-4969-97CF-0DF033641E94","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なんで再帰するんだろ","ts":"1622443434.497000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5MDm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7e044e4-df44-4eec-bd15-88df15ff5729","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とりあえず、さらに1段かますのはどうかな?","ts":"1622443381.495900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QE+H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"321119d1-3ba2-467e-b872-57b91b02109c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Plugのmapについて質問です\n```nmap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-page-down-or-scroll-down-preview) fern#preview#smart_preview(\"\\\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-action-preview:half-down)\", \"\\\u0026lt;C-d\u0026gt;\")\nnmap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-d\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-page-down-or-scroll-down-preview)```\nみたいなことをしたいんですが、nmapだとC-dが再帰mapになってしまって\n```\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-page-down-or-scroll-down-preview)```\nをnnoremapにすると\n```\\\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(fern-action-preview:half-down)```\nが実行されずに困っています。\nこういう場合ってどう回避するのがよさそうでしょうか。\n\nsmart_previewの実装はこんな感じです\n```function! fern#preview#smart_preview(preview, non_preview) abort\n  if s:win.is_visible()\n    return a:preview\n  else\n    return a:non_preview\n  endif\nendfunction```","ts":"1622443029.495500","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1622443167.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9DZ4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d4a0dd1-e899-4eb2-9f75-dbfcfe8fca99","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"gfべんり","ts":"1622437582.493500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pyl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e1655e3-d33d-4e0d-b9bb-4c045d252a3c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"gf完全に雰囲気で使ってる","ts":"1622429580.493000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aDHuZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71c804f3-9ef1-45a9-b3a9-8dc34895a08a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"LSPにこの辺頼り切ってるなあ","ts":"1622429534.492900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01PMN2BVJQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OgZO"}]},{"type":"message","text":"\u003chttps://teratail.com/questions/341308?rss=all|Vueのパスの置換を複数設定できない\u003e\nやりたいこと\nimport Hoge from \"@/Hoge.vue\" // ①\nimport Fuga from \"@@/src/Fuga.vue\" // ②\n\nというようなパスの指定があったときに、Vimのgfコマンドでそれぞれのファイルを開けるようにしたい。  \n試したこと\n.vimrcに以下を記載する  \nautocmd FileType vue setlocal isfname+=@-@  includeexpr=substitute(v:fname,'^@@/','./','')                                                    \nautocmd FileT